  "description": "Shizuko is a modern display typeface inspired by Japanese kanji fonts. This eye-catching font comes in English style (there are no Japanese letters). You can use Shizuko to create rad posters, emblems, stickers, magazines, websites, social media posts, logos, apparel, packaging, and anything else your heart desires. The font is fully kerned and is ready to be used right away. Inject Asian temper and personality into your projects today with Shizuko!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Shizuko is a modern display typeface inspired by Japanese kanji fonts. This eye-catching font comes in English style (there are no Japanese letters). You can use Shizuko to create rad posters, emblems, stickers, magazines, websites, social media posts, logos, apparel, packaging, and anything else your heart desires. The font is fully kerned and is ready to be used right away. Inject Asian temper and personality into your projects today with Shizuko!</p>",
